  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting harmonisation of peace initiatives around the EAC-led Nairobi
dialogue process in Ituri (eastern DRC), SHEPI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Result 1: the coordination of the various peace initiatives underway at the provincial level in Ituri is improved

Outcome 2: Communities based in Ituri (and in specifically targeted areas that are directly affected by the conflict have a better 1) understanding of the commitments made in peace processes at the regional/national level, 2) know how to contribute to these processes , 3) contribute to the process and thus make the process more inclusive of different needs/viewpoints/interests/priorities.

Outcome 3: The specific short-term priorities of the harmonized plan are implemented, demonstrating the benefits of a coordinated approach to implementing the peace process, and communities better understand the concrete benefits they gain.</narrative>
  </description>
